# A range far past the largest array (MAX_ITEMS, 2^28 items) is kept as
# its start, step and count (step 202), so taking from either end,
# dropping, reversing, shifting and scaling by an Int, counting, its
# shape, its first item, its sum, selecting, membership and finding an
# Int cost nothing; the results are the same as on the items.
== SOURCE
-5 t_ake r_ange 1000000000
a := r_ange 1000000000
t_ally a
s_hape a
f_irst a
'+ r_/ a
3 t_ake 10 + 2 * a
-2 t_ake 1 - a
3 t_ake r_ev a
-3 t_ake o_ffsets 1000000000
-2 t_ake 999999995 d_rop a
1000000000 m_ember? a
0 m_ember? a
a i_ndexOf 999999999
(r_ange 3) s_elect r_ev a
